"  / for commands                          ⌥ + s to resume chat                  "
"  ! for shell commands                    ctrl + j for newline                  "
"  tab to queue message                    @ for file paths                      "
"  ⌥ + v to paste images                   ctrl + g to edit in external editor   "
"  esc esc to edit previous message        ctrl + c to exit                      "
"  shift + tab to change mode                                                    "
"  ctrl + t to view transcript                                                   "
